hf_electron_gap  @a18a11d5
  why   A density that lost or gained electrons still converges to a wrong
        answer; this catches it in the iteration it happens.
  setup  the setup: S, method and electron counts
  D     the densities, `[nd, n, n]`
  gap   the largest miscount so far
